        "ggZbT24CyXR_text": "<strong>The Bottom Line</strong>",
        "gg_hWqFcGdT_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">This shilajit resin makes the top 5 simply because we needed at least one resin product to discuss.</span><br><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">It comes with 50 servings per container, and 600mg of shilajit per serving. This is not an extract, so Organics Ocean's One-Per-Day Shilajit is around 10 times as strong as this resin.</span><br><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">However, for a resin product, its pretty good. It's a high-elevation source shilajit starting around $30.</span></p>",
        "ggdTA8uNAEf_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#24931C;font-size:32px;\">Pros</span></p>",
